Gladys Google Gemini integration
Copyright 2026 William-De71

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It sends the AI requests of a Gladys Assistant instance (chat messages, the
history, tool definitions and results, chat images) to the Gemini API of
Google (https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com), with the API key of the
administrator, and returns the answers to Gladys.

